# A Klingon warship destroys a sensor station; while the station's fireball plays, the camera pans beyond the sound's
# maximum distance and back. The fireball fades as the camera leaves, goes silent beyond 2000 units, and is heard
# again once the camera returns. Run it with --layout layouts/sound-fade.jsonc; tools/WavLevel on
# play-out/sound-fade/frame.wav reads about -100 dB from 6.40 to 6.56 seconds and the fireball's tail after.
wait 0.2
select Vorcha6
attack Sensor5
wait 5.3
hold Left 0.95
hold Right 0.8
wait 1.5
expect Sensor5 destroyed = true
